[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_es451")
fish_name = "Drowned Yuri"
grade = 2
sprite = ExtResource("2_a4yhx")
catch_blurb = "Yuri... so beautiful..."
description = "It’s midnight in mystical Pollywood. Two childhood best friends meet in Seashell Cave, their secret hiding place. It was where they first met, surrounded by hollowed-out stone that darkened their scales in the daytime. Now, at night, colorful crystals and bioluminescent algae illuminate their blushing faces—they know no one else will find them here.

“Ever since we were kids, I’ve always been drawn to you…” Fairy murmurs, glancing up at Dotty’s wide-eyed face, then quickly looking back down at the ground.

Dotty smiles knowingly and inches closer to her. “Heh. I always knew it would end up like this.”

“W-What do you mean?”

“You’re telling me you don't feel what I feel?” She maintains eye contact with Fairy, breaking down every remaining wall between them and staring clear into her heart.

Fairy looks down and touches her chest. “I didn’t say that.”

Dotty grabs both of her fins with a serious look on her face. “Fairy…” She hesitates for a moment “I... I... I’M IN LOVE WITH YOU!!!!” Her purple cheeks quickly turn magenta. She holds her breath in anticipation as she waits for Fairy's reply.

Fairy stares at Dotty in disbelief. “Dotty... I LOVE YOU TOO!!!”

The two embrace each other the second Fairy finishes speaking. And after all of these years, with the colorful lights of Seashell Cave dancing around them, they share a long, long overdue kiss…

[★★★☆☆ Where’s the buildup? Who even are these characters?? What is “Seashell Cave”??? Why is it called “Drowned Yuri” if it’s not doomed at all???? …The kiss scene was good, though.
– MSF]
"
